 "sentences": [
  "Antarctica’s first meteorite was found here.",
  "The 1911 Australasian Antarctic Expedition explored uncharted coastlines south of Australia.",
  "Led by Douglas Mawson, the crew covered 4,180 kilometres of unexplored territory.",
  "They set up the first wireless contact between Antarctica and Australia.",
  "They even tried using an aircraft, but it became a useless motorised sledge.",
  "Ultimately, this mission mapped huge stretches of coastline and gathered vital scientific samples."
